# __PROJECT_NAME__

Generated by the first-party ZaakiyJS CLI with the __PRESET__ preset.

## Requirements

Node.js 20.19+ and an installed package manager. ZaakiyJS requires the independently released core, signals, DOM, styles and Vite plugin packages.

## Quick start

```sh
__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ install
__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ run dev
__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ run typecheck
__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ run build
```

The project uses typed TSX, the native DOM mount contract and build-time utility CSS. It does not require a virtual DOM, Tailwind runtime, router, server proxy or AI SDK.

The CLI does not execute package installation scripts during project generation.
